/// 🎞️ The schema id every [`VideoRenderProgram`] states; `🧫️fixtures/🎞️video-render-program/🔣️.json` is its
/// language-agnostic law, `videoRenderProgramProblem` in `🎠️kernel/🟦️.ts` its TypeScript twin.
